-- and what a stable fact warrants (1.3): every history that o2's record admits — every point of o2's fiber
-- over y — lies in o's fiber over the value o2's record fixes. So a report from a system for which the
-- fold is stable is tight about the fold: nothing it admits disagrees with it.
stable-fiber : (H : Type 0) → (o : Observer H) → (o2 : Observer H) → (s : StableFor H o o2) → (y : obs-type H o2) → (h : H) → obs-of H o2 h ≡ y → obs-of H o h ≡ fst s y
stable-fiber H o o2 s y h p = concat (sym (snd s h)) (cong (fst s) p)
